//   retail  +0047 shr edx,0xf / +004a not dl / +004c test dl,1 / +004f jne
//   ours    +0047 test dh,dh                  / +0049 jns
// i.e. retail spends 4 bytes computing (~(v>>15)&1) explicitly; this toolchain
// folds the equivalent 1-bit bitfield read to the 2-byte `test dh,dh` and never
