// (`((unsigned char)~(flags >> 15) & 1)`), DOES compile to retail's
// `shr eax,0xf / not al / test al,1`, because there the value is a plain
// `unsigned` local.  Copying that spelling onto the second test (a union
// bitfield read off `last->m_flags`) makes MSVC 7.1 reload the flags word into
// esi and spend 6 extra bytes on prologue/epilogue shuffling instead, 172 total.
//
